        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00114:alt:fig-00003-alt",
          "text": "The reaction of butane and chlorine in the presence of light. 1-chlorobutane and 2-chlorobutane are formed in a 30:70 ratio and other products are dichloro-, trichloro-, tetrachloro-, and so on."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_10_02_003.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
    },
