        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00114:alt:fig-00004-alt",
          "text": "The reaction of 2-methylpropane and chlorine in the presence of light.  2-chloro-2-methylpropane and 1-chloro-2-methylpropane are formed in a 35:65 ratio and other products are dichloro-, trichloro-, tetrachloro-, and so on."
